命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t078/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/q76-zxitspms/c-25vp30_x/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261016-1' '--attempt' '3ac61c47-a155-4c28-9730-4102b7df8592' '--session' '94fae7df-9d77-41b5-8729-99b59f8cec50' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-16T08:22:26.087Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"3ac61c47-a155-4c28-9730-4102b7df8592","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt_id":"3ac61c47-a155-4c28-9730-4102b7df8592","session_id":"94fae7df-9d77-41b5-8729-99b59f8cec50","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"648033fd-d01b-4fc5-a80f-63bdb07109d1","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"66190870-1bba-4e87-9aff-0994bce43d53","thread":"648033fd-d01b-4fc5-a80f-63bdb07109d1","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-66190870-1bba-4e87-9aff-0994bce43d53"},"workspace":"/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/q76-zxitspms/c-25vp30_x/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261016-1-a1","base_commit":"db6b1f76cf688798ff41525c134eb1cfa548512e","card_snapshot_id":"d280e549-8299-4454-b695-bbb58adacec3","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261016-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-16T08:22:27.296Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"3ac61c47-a155-4c28-9730-4102b7df8592","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/q76-z